[{"id":"107774","date":"2026-09-21T22:10:53+00:00","text":"In January, Iran went dark. But the people who were there kept recording. This Is Our Story brings together their footage and first-hand accounts to document what happened during Iran’s January protests. A four-part documentary series, with English subtitles. مستند چهارقسمتی This Is Our Story دی‌ماه ۱۴۰۴، ایران در تاریکی فرو رفت؛ اما مردمی که آنجا بودند، به ثبت آنچه می‌گذشت ادامه دادند. این مستند، تصاویر و روایت‌های دست‌اول اعتراضات دی‌ماه را کنار هم قرار می‌دهد؛ روایتی از آنچه مردم ایران دیدند و تجربه کردند.","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/Kk8-UVQvKiXG87PoBoAZzzpUVb3ad-18Qqbbo5xUjVgZL8qj4DqTGPSp3mIWIRVxXjI5er8vYr51Nryz04gzIF-Evf5bnVc4B4IvB7RKAPiOyn8L136MiZQu_WU7MkpF_KdI4C0giG1qRPTV-RWSaQFltqT7UMI4uL0T0tYWyFNBSKu7s9EwlVWHWmtqVZVoHcKC286ogBGSWHmjTo__zihkg-BJyzrzg01HujQLLNiL2DoT_pfEP4ClKHsAYus5S-MMDBEFo7xzj8zMS9Xy7kCzJkNVmNro7LhRyeJKNE5NNki-SSrJfezuX6iGKKVJCMvm8a4lyZ6J19s0aVIXZg","video":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/d3fc7ac5c4.mp4?token=lcg8X-wOJZ6EM5vkWzyJJdFvSOOEE7izrV49edkISnJGfdSs4cuz_QtJE-cnql5sevJwLOEQibBeu8u7oyCf9SDvVETSRnbMDVMbqviavDKgCQSrn8XlTKyPCLInFRUPdmvE-VojA-PIu1O57YqrCvNNy24S1qavCtlG6JK6e8Q5VQAznpd5sO9aqZbLIbWc9OwhjZ0jKlUCovW6GTZvLfRJi2JSjn8Ui1jt3O4SRGrXRuGqidXeNWmBxKlINZLlBanX7e0NKVbiycRTpXsB5PC76FiqXKFrq_OfIgBI40JdLlGDpPtyR2eI0I2Wt4_s_ucN_XpAoyXLUxHblYxcNg","hasVideo":true},{"id":"107773","date":"2026-09-21T22:10:46+00:00","text":"«تا سقف جنسه اما همه چیز چندین برابر گرون شده»","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/gLOdExQkjstc3Fo6Gyl0pkP0QfLH2quYzbsa-Wr6PNjvckNT7_u7kvZlgQS3yJ2_8uHKQ9R0Vzi9nUnESuFDi4tGrHrCapkSFcAwqsKkTqp7sgaqLSaGqZbVTBPOOu0W2ve1M9RnZX2KRojg4PbAd11x8nJu6weIjEZfKZP9SWu6Y5gxBCGgeW8vUx4wrxJwESAQBgTtCbZL7z_Oq21oP3Cl9--u56dcakX-eN3Ub2WEvdyui5Un96c5LRqy3uianLYBQYpD8eT0fH_bjSzTalsIiYjFKyDuqCcW6w2a17AwTRp1ywnbSlswodriLx2htHxnoRIYHiEoG1O7JnUzRw","video":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/e8bb0c5a5f.mp4?token=e42KvGWATCz24Zdl7iPO4qyxTZr0-KeH7GkS0511z96luxM6AdsekbbCaXosEgxPeOpAQ8ODtL_E